<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0564a180be70> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8255] With assistance from the bank, Baotou police successfully stop a transfer of about 3.37 million yuan from going into the fraudster's account. [8255] Police are looking to educate the public about a new type of fraud that uses artificial intelligence to mimic faces and voices." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8255" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1d57560e0481> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8261] 近日，包头警方发布一起利用人工智能（AI）实施电信诈骗的典型案例。 [8255] The public security bureau of Baotou, Inner Mongolia autonomous region, is striving to raise awareness after recently handling such a case..." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1e06efa0ea9c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8255] After discovering that the fake friend's account was with Mengshang Bank in Baotou, Fuzhou police soon contacted Baotou police to stop the payment." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8255" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/27da472acc1e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "China scammer uses AI to impersonate victim’s friend, steal $823,000" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/284af0f69511> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8261] 福州市某科技公司法人代表郭先生10分钟内被骗430万元。 [8255] On April 20, a man surnamed Guo, a legal representative of a technology company in Fuzhou, Fujian province, received a video call via WeChat from a friend asking him for help." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2c33bc9f0d63> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8261] 接到报警后，福州、包头两地警银迅速启动止付机制，成功止付拦截336.84万元。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/31972506574e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4749] The potential pitfalls of groundbreaking AI technology have received heightened attention since United States-based company OpenAI in November launched ChatGPT, a chatbot that mimics human speech." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3b54a6e06bb1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4749] Earlier in May, police in the north-western province of Gansu said “coercive measures” had been taken against a man who used ChatGPT to create a fake news article about a deadly bus crash that was spread widely on social media." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3d52ae007059> a airo:Evidence ;
