    airo:sourceDocId "8255" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5fb2f3ffd28b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4749] A law regulating deepfakes, which came into effect in January, bans the use of the technology to produce, publish or transmit false news. [4749] And a draft law proposed in April by Beijing’s Internet regulator would require all new AI products to undergo a “security assessment” before being released to the public." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

