    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0abd6a166042> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8261] 福州市某科技公司法人代表郭先生10分钟内被骗430万元。 [8255] On April 20, a man surnamed Guo, a legal representative of a technology company in Fuzhou, Fujian province, received a video call via WeChat from a friend asking him for help." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1a2badf0e287> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "接到报警后，福州、包头两地警银迅速启动止付机制，成功止付拦截336.84万元。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2b615c496d10> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "China scammer uses AI to impersonate victim’s friend, steal $823,000" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/43753ca7045e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8261] 骗子通过智能AI换脸和拟声技术，佯装好友对他实施了诈骗。 [4749] But the caller was actually a con artist “using smart AI technology to change (his) face” and voice, according to an article published on Monday by a media portal associated with the government in the southern city of Fuzhou." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4c7788ace5b1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Police warn of AI fraud after man duped by 'friend'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8255" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/63f628505ec2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "AI诈骗背后：用照片生成你“露脸说话”的视频仅需30元左右" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8257" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6afa06518bb6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "除了快速AI换脸，用AI手段合成或克隆声音也越来越常见。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8257" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6f373268f00d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Earlier in May, police in the north-western province of Gansu said “coercive measures” had been taken against a man who used ChatGPT to create a fake news article about a deadly bus crash that was spread widely on social media." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/70ea9af458be> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "而这些案件背后，均涉及了AI换脸以及声音合成技术。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8257" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9bb260131286> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8255] Police are looking to educate the public about a new type of fraud that uses artificial intelligence to mimic faces and voices." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8255" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b67dcf09f137> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "骗子通过智能AI换脸和拟声技术，佯装好友对他实施了诈骗。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c33ea939c2eb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But the caller was actually a con artist “using smart AI technology to change (his) face” and voice, according to an article published on Monday by a media portal associated with the government in the southern city of Fuzhou." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c6c6774123bb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "On April 20, a man surnamed Guo, a legal representative of a technology company in Fuzhou, Fujian province, received a video call via WeChat from a friend asking him for help." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8255" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cd52c786c2b9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "只需提供一张照片，就可以让你变成视频中人，或直接生成会眨眼、张嘴的视频。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8257" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d2ac7a537f04> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A law regulating deepfakes, which came into effect in January, bans the use of the technology to produce, publish or transmit false news." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4749" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d5e46643564b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "据中新经纬了解，目前虚拟摄像头就可以做到这一点。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8257" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e4ba85d276a4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "骗子通过智能AI换脸和拟声技术，佯装好友对他实施了诈骗。" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8261" .

